{"4667330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Re: Haruka", "steam_appid": 4667330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason, you find yourself trapped inside an abandoned shrine.You must survive here for seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is divided into four time periods.If you notice that something in the scene has changed during a certain time period, go back.If you find nothing unusual, move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While trapped here, you encounter a girl named Haruka.She is the only other victim who, just like you, is trapped inside the shrine.As the time periods pass, more of the story will gradually unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is this girl, really?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD: Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC: Settings</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason, you find yourself trapped inside an abandoned shrine.You must survive here for seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is divided into four time periods.If you notice that something in the scene has changed during a certain time period, go back.If you find nothing unusual, move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While trapped here, you encounter a girl named Haruka.She is the only other victim who, just like you, is trapped inside the shrine.As the time periods pass, more of the story will gradually unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is this girl, really?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD: Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC: Settings</p>", "short_description": "A solo-developed anomaly-finding × story-driven game.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</st